# Progress updates

Follow `docs/agents/progress.md` (not always-on — load when recording progress or compacting).

- Update the correct layer: task → ROADMAP → current-state.
- Compaction in place: Active-Phase Compaction; current-state = current truth; CONTEXT = glossary only.
- Archive under `docs/archive/<kebab-slug>/` (or single `.md`) per when-to-archive; leave live pointer.
- Never archive live `CONTEXT.md` / `CONTEXT-MAP.md`; never relocate ADRs from `docs/adr/`.
